See ../LICENSE for the full GPL-3.0 text.

These presets were written for LED matrices from 64×64 through 256×256
(inclusive). They are not copies of Cream of the Crop, Winamp Milkdrop,
or other third-party packs.

The `modern/` subdirectory is a curated MIT-licensed selection from
M0Rf30/projectm-presets. See `modern/LICENSE` and `modern/README.md`.
